cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "AMR Console: an office assistant for an autonomous mobile robot, in simulation"
abstract: >-
  A browser console for an autonomous mobile robot, tested in simulation. It maps an office and
  explores it on its own, navigates with Nav2, and takes plain-English office requests, which it
  reads back and waits to have confirmed before the robot moves. It runs on ROS 2 Jazzy with
  Gazebo Harmonic and a TurtleBot3 Waffle, with a local language model.
version: 1.0.1
